### 🔑 How to Link Your Accounts (Takes < 1 Minute!)

Sync your subscriptions and unlock your sub islands with these easy steps:

1. **Log in** at **<https://www.chopaeng.com/login>** using your primary account (Discord, Twitch, Patreon).
2. Head over to your **Profile Settings**: **<https://www.chopaeng.com/profile>**
3. In the **"Linked Platforms"** card on the right, click **Connect** next to:
   - 💜 **Twitch**
   - 🧡 **Patreon**
   - 💙 **Discord**
4. Authorize each account. Once connected, your tier status updates immediately and unlocks your sub islands!

> 💡 Not subscribed? Login in anyway — you can still access the stream Dodo codes, and make an order in the Order Bot.

