### ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Register Your In-Game Character (IGN & Island)

To protect the islands from code leaks and keep flights smooth, **all travelers must now register at least one In-Game Character before revealing Dodo codes**:

1. Go to **<https://www.chopaeng.com/profile>**
2. Under **"Saved In-Game Characters"**, click **➕ Add Character**.
3. Enter your **In-Game Name (IGN)** and **Island Name**, and set it as **Default**.
4. That's it! Your IGN will auto-populate your Order Bot and Drop Bot requests, and you'll be verified to reveal Dodo codes instantly.

