### 🛠️ How to Use the New Bot & Island Features

#### 🪂 1. Sub Drop Bot & Villager Injector (Sub Islands)
- When visiting any sub island with an active membership, check the island page (e.g. **<https://www.chopaeng.com/islands>**).
- Click **"Drop Bot"** or **"Inject Villager"** in the top bar or under Current Residents.
- Drop up to **9 custom items** or choose any villager to move into **Plots 0–9** in real-time!

#### 📦 2. 40-Slot Order Bot (Order Bot & Free Islands)
- Need full inventory deliveries of items, DIYs, materials, or villagers straight to your private island?
- Use the **Command Builder** (**<https://www.chopaeng.com/command-builder>**) to load your 40-slot pocket, then hit **Order Bot** (**<https://www.chopaeng.com/order>**)!

